<title>UK: UK notes in circulation rise adjusted 6.2 pct.</title>
<headline>UK notes in circulation rise adjusted 6.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British bank notes in circulation rose an adjusted 6.2 percent in the week to March 12 over the equivalent year-ago week, the Bank of England said.</p>
<p>Last week the rise was also 6.2 percent.</p>
<p>NOTES IN CIRCULATION (in rounded bln stg) -</p>
<p>				Latest week  pvs week	yr-ago week</p>
<p> Notes in circulation     20.74	  20.77	   19.54</p>
<p> Bankers' deposits	   2.08	   2.019	   1.796</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
